%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-types-coercion (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
    "enNumber": "12.3",
    "esNumber": "12,3",
    "esDate": "31-dic.-20",
    "enDate": "31-Dec-20"
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{
    enNumber: 12.3 as String {format: "##.##", locale: "en"},
    esNumber: 12.3 as String {format: "##.##", locale: "es"},
    esDate: "2020-12-31" as Date as String {format: "dd-MMM-yy", locale: "es"},
    enDate: "2020-12-31" as Date as String {format: "dd-MMM-yy", locale: "en"}
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "enNumber": "12.3",
  "esNumber": "12,3",
  "esDate": "31-dic-20",
  "enDate": "31-Dec-20"
}
